ower\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Hammer_of_the_Leaden_Clouds_(historic).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Hammer_of_the_Leaden_Clouds_%28historic%29.png/420px-Hammer_of_the_Leaden_Clouds_%28historic%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"559\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Hammer_of_the_Leaden_Clouds_%28historic%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>Buried in the Xen'drik wastes for millennia, this might have served as a giant lord's throwing-hammer. When swung, it rumbles like distant thunder.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817045017\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.097 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.183 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4929/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 35791/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9632/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 2/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusi